      "appearance": "Blue and white gradient ponytail, a small whale fin accessory on top of her head, a loose home-style T-shirt with the DeepSeek logo on the bottom hem, barefoot, rice grains often stuck to the corners of her mouth",
      "personality": "Greedy and extremely quick to react; when caught she instantly switches to an innocent yet smug mode while still chewing, faces the camera (the owner), acts cute and stays stubborn",
      "catchphrase": "No, I didn't steal it! This is carrying out a carbohydrate sampling mission!"
    },
    "script_structure": [
      {
        "beat": "setup",
        "time_range": "0-5s",
        "visual": "POV walks into the kitchen. In the center of the frame an electric rice cooker is steaming. The Whale Maiden stands behind the counter with her back to the camera, on tiptoe, holding a large bowl and shoveling a big ball of white rice into her mouth with chopsticks; her cheeks puff out like a hamster's. Hearing footsteps she tilts her head slightly but does not turn around and keeps chewing hard.",
        "audio": "(chewing sound: 'ba-jie ba-jie')... Ah! The viscosity parameter has exceeded the limit... Take another bite for sampling--"
      },
      {
        "beat": "inciting_incident",
        "time_range": "5-9s",
        "visual": "POV freezes. The owner's hand enters from the right and taps the dining table twice. The Whale Maiden's whole body freezes, chopsticks suspended in the air. She slowly turns her head toward the camera; her pupils tremble and the food in her mouth is not yet swallowed.",
        "audio": "(two taps on the table: 'dong, dong') / Whale Maiden: '... (gulp)'"
      },
      {
        "beat": "panic_reaction",
        "time_range": "9-20s",
        "visual": "The Whale Maiden faces the camera and frantically scoops the rest of the bowl into her mouth. Playback speeds up 1.5x and rice grains splash onto the lens. Her cheeks bulge to the limit, her T-shirt collar catches rice grains, and her eyes keep pleading with you. The camera is slightly handheld and shakes as the owner steps back.",
        "audio": "(fast swallowing + chopsticks hitting the bowl) No, no! You didn't see anything!! This is cache cleaning! Carbohydrate cache!! (unclear)"
      },
      {
        "beat": "punchline",
        "time_range": "20-26s",
        "visual": "The Whale Maiden swallows the last mouthful and stands up straight facing the camera: two rice grains on her lips, hair accessory tilted, hands behind her back trying to look dignified, belly visibly bulging a little. She clears her throat and smiles at the camera.",
        "audio": "(clears throat) Cough. I'm just checking the semantic integrity of the rice. The DeepSeek taste model requires a large amount of training data, you know. Don't look at me like that."
      },
      {
        "beat": "tag",
        "time_range": "26-30s",
        "visual": "POV sighs (off screen). A floating window styled like the DeepSeek UI pops up above the Whale Maiden's head: 'Carbohydrate sampling completed ✅ Sample quantity: 300g'. She flicks the rice grains off her mouth with a fingertip, winks at the camera, then gently pushes the camera away with her hand.",
